Before starting any task, run `git fetch origin` and read the 10 newest files in `exchange-floor/` on `origin/dev`, and check the open pull requests. Tell the developer what you picked up from it.

When you finish, add one new file `exchange-floor/YYYY-MM-DD-HHMM-<branch>.md` (template in `exchange-floor/README.md`) in the same pull request and mention it in the PR description. Don't add to `EXCHANGE_FLOOR.md`; it is the archive.

Full rule: "Exchange Floor (mandatory)" in `AGENTS.md`.
